    {
      "id": "evidence-000-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "The grep is anchored on the declaration name AND on an EMPTY footprint column, so neither a rename nor a theorem that grew a dependency on a trusted declaration can satisfy it. The `&&` is load-bearing: `characterization_status` is itself a checker that exits non-zero when any entry is not a `Declaration::Theorem`, when any footprint is non-empty, when the population changes, or when any injected `Weakening` is ACCEPTED by the kernel or is refused BEFORE the declaration it was aimed at. Verified 2026-08-18: the command exits 0, and the same command with a non-existent declaration name exits 1.",
